{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52426","headline":"回波乐 六十九 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 六十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）剥削。\n贮积千年调，拟觅□□□。\n□□□□□，□□[□□]恶。\n方便还他债，駈遣耕田□。\n□鼻断领牛，杖打过腿膊。\n自造还自受，努力只当却。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}